§ `Tests -- s 24`

#ASSERT `s 24(2) the Secretary of State may determine the earnings by computation or by specifying a sum` (`s 22 test tax year beginning in` 1987) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 24(2) the Secretary of State may determine the earnings by computation or by specifying a sum` (`s 22 test tax year beginning in` 1986) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 24(2) the Secretary of State may determine the earnings by computation or by specifying a sum` (`s 22 test tax year beginning in` 2000) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The permission itself (PARTY ... MAY): the Secretary of State computes; or does not (a lapsed MAY is benign).
#TRACE `s 24(2)(a) the Secretary of State may compute the earnings` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 24(2) the Secretary of State` DOES `s 24(2)(a) compute an amount to be regarded as the earnings` AT 3
#TRACE `s 24(2)(b) the Secretary of State may take the earnings to be a specified sum` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 24(2) the Secretary of State` DOES `s 24(2)(b) take the earnings to be a sum specified in the particular case` AT 3
#EVAL `s 24(2)(a) the Secretary of State may compute the earnings` FALSE
